  {
   "id": "double-dragon-gaiden-rise-of-the-dragons-248358@patch-2023-09-21",
   "gameId": "double-dragon-gaiden-rise-of-the-dragons-248358",
   "displayName": "The Second Patch is Live!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-21T16:00:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Dragon Warriors!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're excited to announce that today we've released our second patch for Double Dragon Gaiden: Rise of the Dragons! In it, you'll find invulnerability buffs, command run functionality and many quality of life changes. Here's the full list of patch notes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Movement Break Changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Light brake/land no longer limits player's movement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Heavy brake/land duration are shortened.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Invulnerability Changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Characters are invulnerable when performing throw and slam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Characters are invulnerable when knocked, unless they bounce off the wall.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All grapple special moves are invulnerable if the player grabs the target successfully.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jimmy’s SP3 is invulnerable for a few frames on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Uncle Matin’s SP3 is invulnerable for a few frames on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chin Tai Mei’s SP3 is invulnerable for a few frames on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Linda’s SP1 is invulnerable for a few frames on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Duke’s SP3 is invulnerable for a few frames on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Command Run Changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Billy, Jimmy, Chin Tai Mei and Linda will perform a dodge roll when you initiate running.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When performing a dodge roll, they are invulnerable and can pick up items and weapons except dynamite.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Uncle Matin, Burnov and Willy pushes the target when you initiate running.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Duke teleport and becomes invulnerable when you initiate running.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Abobo has armor property when running.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Anubis will disappear and becomes invulnerable after running for a while.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Miscellaneous Gameplay Changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Projectile and thrown weapons Z-Axis hitbox size has been reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Frequency of enemies attacking from out of screen has been reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Certain special moves for some characters have had minor buffs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Breakable object can also be broken with 2 stunlock hits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since players were buffed with more invulnerability, the overall difficulty has increased (especially in earlier missions).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HP recovered from hotdog has been reduced to 15.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HP recovery from burger has been reduced to 40.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Miscellaneous Quality of Life Changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mission Select's gang evolution cutscene can now be skipped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay tips have been added to Now Loading scenes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Through the option menu, you can choose to make defeated enemies disappear over time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Through the option menu, you can enable/disable screenshake.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Through the option menu, you can enable/disable double tap forward to run.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Through the option menu, you can enable/disable controller vibration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Through the option menu, you can enable/disable each HUD and floating HUD element.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any feedback or run into any bugs, please reach out on the Discord server or the Steam forums!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Until next time,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your Secret Base and Modus teams",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
